# Flutter rules (Dart layer); native android/ and ios/ trees use the native rule sets
# Generated from the threat library cards (threats/android, threats/ios, threats/shared); each rule cites its card.
# Fields (tab-separated, "-" = empty):
#   rule_id threat_id severity type file_globs pattern message card flags [exclude]
# Severity: high/critical block the build by default; medium/low warn.
# Heuristic rules are kept one level below the card severity so they warn.
FL-TLS-001	incorrect-certificate-validation	critical	match	*.dart	badCertificateCallback[[:space:]]*=.*=>[[:space:]]*true|badCertificateCallback[[:space:]]*=[^;]*\{[[:space:]]*return[[:space:]]+true|validateCertificate[[:space:]]*:.*=>[[:space:]]*true	Certificate errors are accepted: remove badCertificateCallback / validateCertificate overrides (use certificate pinning that rejects on mismatch)	shared/crypto/incorrect-certificate-validation.md	-
FL-TLS-002	android-webview-tls-bypass	critical	match	*.dart	ServerTrustAuthResponseAction\.PROCEED	WebView proceeds on TLS errors: return ServerTrustAuthResponseAction.CANCEL	android/webview/android-webview-tls-bypass.md	-
FL-ST-001	sensitive-data-in-client-storage	medium	imatch	*.dart	\.(setstring|write|put)\([[:space:]]*["'][^"']*(token|password|passwd|secret|jwt|session|cvv)	Heuristic: credential stored in SharedPreferences/Hive/GetStorage (plaintext): use flutter_secure_storage (Keychain / Keystore)	shared/data-privacy/sensitive-data-in-client-storage.md	-	[Ss]ecure[Ss]torage|secure_storage
FL-WV-001	android-webview-javascript-interface	medium	match	*.dart	addJavaScriptChannel\(|javascriptChannels[[:space:]]*:|addJavaScriptHandler\(	JavaScript channel is callable by every page the WebView loads: load only trusted https content and check the origin in the handler	android/webview/android-webview-javascript-interface.md	-
FL-WV-002	android-webview-file-access	high	match	*.dart	(allowFileAccessFromFileURLs|allowUniversalAccessFromFileURLs|allowFileAccess)[[:space:]]*:[[:space:]]*true|setAllowFileAccess\([[:space:]]*true	WebView file access is enabled: keep it false and load bundled pages as assets	android/webview/android-webview-file-access.md	-
FL-WV-003	ios-wkwebview-message-handlers	high	match	*.dart	(runJavaScript|runJavaScriptReturningResult|evaluateJavascript)\([[:space:]]*(source:[[:space:]]*)?('[^']*\$|\"[^\"]*\$)	JavaScript is built by string interpolation (script injection): JSON-encode the data (jsonEncode) or pass it via a message channel	ios/webview/ios-wkwebview-message-handlers.md	-
FL-WV-004	android-webview-tls-bypass	high	match	*.dart	MIXED_CONTENT_ALWAYS_ALLOW	Mixed content allowed in the WebView: keep MIXED_CONTENT_NEVER_ALLOW	android/webview/android-webview-tls-bypass.md	-
FL-LOG-001	sensitive-data-in-logs	high	match	*.dart	(^|[^A-Za-z_])(print|debugPrint|log|developer\.log|logger\.[a-z]+)\(.*(\$\{?|\+[[:space:]]*|,[[:space:]]*)[A-Za-z_.]*([Pp]assword|[Pp]asswd|[Tt]oken|[Ss]ecret|[Jj]wt|JWT|[Cc]vv|CVV|[Oo]tp[^a-z]|OTP|PASSWORD|TOKEN|SECRET)	Credential written to the device log: remove it or log a redacted value	shared/data-privacy/sensitive-data-in-logs.md	-
